Z||000000||FieroBritney||07-16-2001||08:19 PM||||Pasted below are the details. I hope it formats ok. It's too much to retype.<P>NORTHWEST FIERO FEST 2001 <BR>RICHLAND, WASHINGTON, AUGUST 10, 11, 12 <P>SCHEDULE OF EVENTS <BR>FRIDAY EVENING, AUG. 10TH: Pick up your " goodie bag " and event info, and enjoy a light meal and beverages on the lawn next to the Columbia River. 7:00 til 9:00 PM <BR>SATURDAY MORNING, AUG. 11TH: Show lot opens at 8:00 at McCurley Pontiac in Pasco. McCurley is providing wash and detail bays, first come, first serve. Judging begins at 11:00 AM sharp. Show ends at 2:00 PM. <BR>SATURDAY EVENING: Banquet and awards at the Tower Inn in Richland. After the banquet, we will go on a 11 mile cruise on George Washington Drive with the assistance of the local law enforcement. <BR>SUNDAY MORNING, AUG. 12TH: Breakfast with friends, then out to the back lot at 9;00 AM for " slow drags, and the infamous " bean bag toss". About 12:00 noon we will say farewell til next year. <P>REGISTRATION INFORMATION <BR>CLASSIFICATIONS <BR>A.	84 Stock coupe/SE B. 84 Stock Indy Pace Car C. 85 Stock coupe/ SE D. 85 Stock GT <BR>B.	E. 86 Stock coupe/SE F. 86 Stock GT G. 87 Stock coupe/SE H. 87 Stock GT I. 88 Stock coupe <BR>C.	J. 88 Stock Formula K. 88 Stock GT L. Mera/Zimmer M.Custom N.Custom Modified <BR>D.	O.Super Modified P.Kit Car Q. Concours ( 2000 miles or less for each year of existence, any model ) <P>REGISTRATION DUE BY JULY, 20. AFTER THAT ADD $ 10.00 <BR>Registration fee....................................	$ 35.00 <BR>Late fee................................................	______ <BR>Friday reception (per person)..............	$ 5.00 <BR>Banquet (per person)..........................	$ 25.00 <BR>Additional T-Shirts ( each )..................	$ 15.00 <BR>(one free with registration) <BR>Med___ Large___XL___XXL____ <BR>Additional dash plaque (one free).......	$ 3.00 <BR>Check #________ TOTAL.........		$________ <P>MAKE CHECKS PAYABLE TO: PEGASUS PRODUCTIONS <BR>12530 182ND AVE. S.E. <BR>SNOHOMISH, WA. 98290 <P>CONTACT SHILO INN DIRECT FOR ROOM RESERVATIONS  ( 509 ) 946-4661 <P>REGIONAL CONTACTS <BR>BOISE IDAHO: Bill Grant Fiero84@aol.com <BR>BRITISH COLUMBIA: David Bergquist Captfieroofbc@home.com <BR>PORTLAND, OREGON: Dan Tucker 17ccm@home.com <BR>RENO, NEVADA: Kym Robinson Fieroroadclub@aol.com <BR>WESTERN WASHINGTON: Ben Didlot Benjamatic@aol.com <BR>EASTERN WASHINGTON: Greg Gulliford Lilrdfiero@servershare.net <BR>HOTEL ROOM RATES <BR>1-2 PERSONS $65.00 <BR>2-4 PERSONS $75.00 <BR>Make reservations by July 9th to lock in these rates <BR>From I-82, exit on George Washington Dr. and head north<P>||||reg||1
